  "label": "Mosquito as a metaphor for danger or threat",
  "description": "The meme uses the mosquito as a visual metaphor for something that appears small or insignificant but is actually dangerous. This metaphorical use requires background knowledge about how metaphors function in language and culture — that is, how a small insect can symbolize a larger, more serious threat. This is a common rhetorical device in humor and satire.",
